@startuml
title Innorder OCC - System Context
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
}

actor Participant as participant
actor "Process Owner / Teacher" as owner
actor Administrator as admin
actor "Resource Manager" as resourceManager

rectangle "Innorder OCC\nDeterministic workflow control + probabilistic intelligence" as occ #E0F2FE
cloud "OIDC Identity Provider" as oidc
cloud "Model Providers" as llm
cloud "Customer Infrastructure" as infrastructure
cloud "Authorized Update Source" as updates

participant --> occ : tasks, evidence, guidance
owner --> occ : review, intervention, modeling
admin --> occ : identity, policy, configuration
resourceManager --> occ : capacity and reservations
occ --> oidc : authentication federation
occ --> llm : policy-filtered prompts and retrieval context
occ --> infrastructure : database, object, event, cache services
occ --> updates : signed desktop updates

note bottom of occ
  PostgreSQL is the structured source of truth.
  AI recommendations cannot directly advance critical workflow state.
end note
@enduml
